  - line: 12
    type: narration
    text: "@scene_meta_focus: Geralt and Oreck return to the compound; Geralt grants vocal speech to Mika and freed slaves while respecting the Five's refusal of modification, and outlines plans to liberate three nearby Anunnaki camps."
  - line: 13
